+# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only OR MIT
+# J713 (13-inch M4 MacBook Air) basic platform, using the firmware framebuffer.
+# Merge after arm64 defconfig and asahi.config, then run olddefconfig.
+# Companion m1n1/U-Boot retained-input and per-kernel DTB handoffs are required.
+
+# Limit this device-specific configuration to Apple platform support.
+CONFIG_ARCH_APPLE=y
+# CONFIG_ARCH_ACTIONS is not set
